.TH MARBOR\-SETTINGS 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-settings \- get/set the full control\-plane config
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor settings
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
get/set the full control\-plane config
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B get
print the current settings (secrets masked)
.TP
.B set
apply a settings payload from a local JSON file
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-file string
local JSON file with the (partial) settings payload (required) (required)
.RE
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
